  "7521216502599995392": {
   "created": 1793197751,
   "author": "Inspired Capital",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/inspired-capital-partners_growing-companies-think-their-biggest-problem-activity-7521216502599995392-CXIv",
   "text": "Onboarding is one of the biggest bottlenecks for fast-growing teams. Windmill just launched Agentic Onboarding to fix that. Windy, their AI agent, guides every new hire from day one with a personalized plan, company knowledge, and the right manager support, all in Slack. New hires onboarded with Windmill ramp 3x faster.\n\nWindmill already has a fast-growing roster of customers, like Etched, that are seeing incredible results. Congrats Brian Distelburger, Max Shaw, Mark Tanner and the Windmill team on the launch!",
   "disc_score": 2,
   "checks": {
