  "7521264448121233408": {
   "created": 1793209182,
   "author": "Index Ventures",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/index-ventures_congratulations-again-to-benjamin-s-and-activity-7521264448121233408-GJOf",
   "text": "Congratulations again to Benjamin S. and the whole team at Flapping Airplanes on their $1B Series A.\n\nFresh off the announcement, our partner Mark Xu sat down with Ben, Flappy\u2019s CEO and co-founder. They talked about everything from his running the student incubator Prod, where he saw startups like Cursor, Mercor, Etched, and dozens of others up close, to building a research lab with a mission to make AI orders of magnitude more efficient. They also get into what Ben believes separates founders from everyone else, and the values he\u2019s bringing to the team: staying focused on fundamentals in an ecosystem full of distractions, and holding their research to the strongest baselines they can come u",
   "disc_score": 46,
