  "7521281448989999104": {
   "created": 1793213236,
   "author": "Jared Cohen",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cohenjar_i-dont-know-anyone-who-thinks-their-company-activity-7521281448989999104-ZBh_",
   "text": "I don\u2019t know anyone who thinks their company does a particularly great job at onboarding new hires. It\u2019s one of the most overlooked parts of building a successful company and usually one of the highest-leverage things to improve upon.\n\nIt is honestly insane that people don't spend more time getting this right given onboarding sets the tone for someone\u2019s entire trajectory within the business. How fast a new hire gets productive, whether they become a top performer, and whether they feel supported while doing so can all be traced back to these early weeks. \n\nToday we\u2019re announcing the system that finally allows companies to launch new hires out of a cannon with repeatable and measurable succes",
   "disc_score": 31,
