   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/faithzlee_two-years-in-when-i-joined-etched-we-activity-7521340767278239744--CFG",
   "text": "Two years in! \ud83c\udf89\nWhen I joined Etched, we were a team of 60. Today, we\u2019re at 500. Growing like that in just two years is no easy feat, and it\u2019s only possible because the people here are truly extraordinary.\n\nThis past year brought even more excitement, from enjoying box seats at a Barracuda game to taking my first business trip to Taiwan! These are experiences I never expected, and I got to share them with people I love working with, who push me to be my best.\n\nMy greatest surprise has been my run club. It\u2019s become one of my favorite parts of the week, and I\u2019ve loved every mile of it.\n\nIt has been so great, and I\u2019m grateful for every bit of it. Looking forward to more new experiences as I kee",
